[B][COLOR=#00bfff]★ What makes EzShops different?[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Guided storefront menus[/B]: Category icons, quantity pickers, bulk buttons, and lore templates keep every purchase clear for players and staff.
[*][B]Smart price automation[/B]: Dynamic buy/sell multipliers nudge values after each transaction and persist to shop-dynamic.yml so your market keeps evolving between restarts.
[*][B]Rotating daily specials[/B]: Schedule weighted or sequential rotations from shop/rotations/ and highlight limited-time offers without rewriting your categories.
[*][B]Sign shop mirroring[/B]: Sync right-click signs with any menu entry, customize headers and line formats, and let towns trade without opening the GUI.
[*][B]Specialty entries out of the box[/B]: Sell spawners with correctly tagged block states, issue minion or vote crate keys, and keep cosmetic minion heads restricted to crates.
[*][B]Player-run marketplaces[/B]: [icode][shop][/icode] signs convert into owner-branded listings that pull stock from linked chests while enforcing permissions and chest access rules.
[*][B]Category commands[/B]: Instantly run a server command when a category icon is clicked, instead of opening a shop. Use this for warps, info, or custom features (see config example below).
[*][B]Sell boosts: [/B]Add sell boosts through our [URL='https://modrinth.com/plugin/ezboost']EzBoost plugin[/URL] integration
[*][B]Live config reload[/B]: Use [icode]/shop reload[/icode] (permission [icode]ezshops.reload[/icode]) to instantly reload all shop configuration files and update menus without restarting your server.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#00bfff]⚡ Player-facing commands[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]/shop[/B]: Open the menu or browse a flat paginated list when categories are disabled.
[*][B]/shop buy & /shop sell[/B]: Trade directly from chat with material names and optional amounts.
[*][B]/sellhand & /sellinventory[/B]: Cash out specific stacks or an entire inventory in one click, with summary receipts.
[*][B]/price[/B]: Let players and staff quote live buy/sell totals using tab-complete across every configured material.
[*][B]/shop reload[/B]: Instantly reload all shop configuration files and update menus (permission [icode]ezshops.reload[/icode]).
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#ff9900]⛃ Stock Market Features[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Live Stock Market Pricing[/B]: Certain shop items use a real-time stock market price that changes based on player trading activity and random market events.
[*][B]Configurable controls[/B]: Admins can block or override specific items from the stock market via config, and all trading commands are permission-based with optional per-player cooldowns.
[*][B]Persistent state[/B]: Frozen prices and admin overrides are saved and persist across server restarts.
[*][B]How It Works:[/B] The price for these items is calculated as follows:
[/LIST]
[quote]
New price = max(1.0, current price × (1 + (demand × 0.02) + random volatility))

Where:
- [B]demand[/B] is positive for player purchases, negative for sales
- [B]random volatility[/B] is a value between -10% and +10% per update
- Prices never fall below 1.0 coins
[/quote]
This means buying increases the price, selling decreases it, and random market swings keep things interesting!

[B][COLOR=#ff9900]⛃ Stock Market Commands[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]/stock buy <item> <amount>[/B]: Buy shares in a stock market item at the current price.
[*][B]/stock sell <item> <amount>[/B]: Sell your shares for the current market price.
[*][B]/stock info <item>[/B]: View the current price, recent changes, and volatility for a specific item.
[*][B]/stock list[/B]: See all stock market items and their current prices.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#ff9900]⛃ Admin Stock Market Controls[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]/stockadmin freeze <item>[/B]: Freeze or unfreeze the price of a stock market item (requires [icode]ezshops.stock.admin.freeze[/icode]). Frozen state persists across restarts.
[*][B]/stockadmin set <item> <price>[/B]: Set the price of a stock market item directly (requires [icode]ezshops.stock.admin.set[/icode]).
[*][B]/stockadmin list [page][/B]: List all stock market items, their prices, and frozen status, with pagination and metadata showing who/when (requires [icode]ezshops.stock.admin.list[/icode]).
[*][B]/stockadmin info <item>[/B]: View detailed info, including who froze an item and when (requires [icode]ezshops.stock.admin.info[/icode]).
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#ff9900]⛃ Stock Market Permissions[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.buy[/icode]: Allow buying stock market items.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.sell[/icode]: Allow selling stock market items.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.info[/icode]: Allow viewing stock info.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.list[/icode]: Allow listing all stock market items.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.admin.freeze[/icode]: Allow freezing/unfreezing items.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.admin.set[/icode]: Allow setting prices directly.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.admin.list[/icode]: Allow listing all items with admin details.
[*][icode]ezshops.stock.admin.info[/icode]: Allow viewing admin info for items.
[/LIST]

[B][COLOR=#00bfff]️ Configuration toolkit[/COLOR][/B]
[LIST]
[*][B]Instant defaults[/B]: First launch seeds shop.yml, menu layouts, and category presets so you can adjust icons, lore, and prices immediately.
[*][B]Flexible layouts[/B]: Pick per-category sizes, filler items, back buttons, and slot placements or fall back to a flat /shop list.
[*][B]Category commands[/B]: Add a command: field to any category config (e.g. shop/categories/warp.yml). When clicked, the command runs for the player (supports {player} placeholder). Example:
[code=yaml]
menu-title: '&bWarp Menu'
icon:
  material: ENDER_PEARL
  display-name: '&bWarps'
slot: 0
command: 'warp main {player}'
[/code]
[*][B]Rotations and specials[/B]: Build timed lineups in shop/rotations/, assign them via rotation-group, and let the plugin cycle icons, menu titles, and items automatically.
[*][B]Dynamic pricing defaults[/B]: Tune global multipliers in config.yml and override them per entry to automate supply-and-demand swings.
[*][B]Sign formatting[/B]: Adjust accepted headers and line colors to match your branding without breaking existing signage.
[*][B]Player shop tuning[/B]: Toggle the entire system with [icode]player-shops.enabled[/icode], enforce quantity or price limits, and rewrite owner/item/stock lines through the dedicated sign-format placeholders.
[*][B]/playershop setup flow[/B]: Give creators a menu-driven way to prefill quantity and pricing, complete with +/- buttons that honor your configured minimums and caps before they ever place a sign.
[*][B]Localized messaging[/B]: Point [icode]language[/icode] in [icode]config.yml[/icode] to files like [icode]messages/messages_fr.yml[/icode]. Bundle new locales inside your jar (and add them to [icode]EzShopsPlugin.DEFAULT_SHOP_RESOURCES[/icode]) so they copy to [icode]plugins/EzShops/messages/[/icode] on first launch.
[/LIST]

